{"availability":"available","full":"flwfdd/TokenTour","name":"TokenTour","description":"「Token 之旅」交互式 LLM/Agent 教程","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"TypeScript","stars":9,"forks":0,"created":"2026-05-26T07:46:20Z","updated":"2026-10-16T17:03:27Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://tokentour.flwfdd.xyz","topics":[],"demo":"https://tokentour.flwfdd.xyz/chat2token/playground","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T11:02:15.642Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T11:02:15.642Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T11:02:15.642Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T14:33:21.334Z","stars":9,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-04T16:12:40.918Z","stars":9,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-06T17:12:37.643Z","stars":9,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T22:30:36.698Z","stars":9,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T09:01:54.884Z","stars":9,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-17T11:02:15.642Z","stars":9,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A vertical cross-section of the LLM application stack—from Agent messages to tokens and KV cache.","LLM applications look simple from the outside, but a single turn passes through many layers: Agent messages, chat templates, tokenization, the context window, attention, and KV cache. Each layer has its own representation, and the connections between them are easy to lose.","TokenTour makes a vertical cut through that stack. Instead of explaining one layer in isolation, it follows the same conversation downward and shows how a change at one level propagates through the rest."],"features":["Messages → chat template: compare how model families such as Qwen3, DeepSeek-V3, and GPT-OSS serialize the same conversation and tool calls.","Text → tokens: inspect token boundaries, byte-level behavior, and how small edits change the sequence.","Tokens → context and KV cache: see causal attention, estimate KV memory, and visualize which prefix could be reused on the next turn.","Cross-layer tracing: hover or select an item to follow the corresponding region across the synchronized views."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/flwfdd/TokenTour/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"15dfeca4cf746a79fa9ea39556eabdc7677eb04f1781735b928300015ea497d4","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T07:01:58.105Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T09:01:54.958Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A vertical cross-section of the LLM application stack—from Agent messages to tokens and KV cache.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/flwfdd/TokenTour/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"not_required","text":"The playground includes prepared Agent traces, so no API key is needed.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/flwfdd/TokenTour/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"15dfeca4cf746a79fa9ea39556eabdc7677eb04f1781735b928300015ea497d4","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/flwfdd/TokenTour/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T09:01:54.958Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-08-19T02:50:59Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T09:01:54.884Z","overviewAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T02:11:44.227Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/flwfdd/TokenTour/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T09:01:54.958Z","hash":"15dfeca4cf746a79fa9ea39556eabdc7677eb04f1781735b928300015ea497d4","originalBytes":2944,"storedBytes":2944,"truncated":false},"qualityPriority":false,"enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T05:50:53.012Z","latestRelease":null,"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T05:50:53.012Z","screenshots":[{"src":"previews/a3399910c301743bd2ba13da.jpg","kind":"demo","capturedAt":"2026-10-17T11:22:04.355Z","url":"https://tokentour.flwfdd.xyz/chat2token/playground"}],"previewAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T11:22:04.355Z","demoHealth":{"url":"https://tokentour.flwfdd.xyz/chat2token/playground","attemptedAt":"2026-10-17T11:22:04.355Z","status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-17T11:22:04.355Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-17T11:22:04.355Z","target":"https://tokentour.flwfdd.xyz/chat2token/p